SDK patch 0312 (Max Payne 3 port): the scaled-fetch trace names the pixel shader and its slot. The scene and
the bloom chain mix exp_adjust -11 and -13 reads of one resolved address (a x4 difference); with the PS number and
the fetch's num_format in the line, one run tells which draw reads its texture four times brighter than the game
meant - the input the tonemap curve cannot place (BurnoutLimit 1 saturates above L 0.58).

